  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 524.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 524.01 Applicability. This part shall apply to residential, commercial, and industrial development projects, including associated roadways, in non-tidal wetlands.\n\nSource. #12805, eff 12-15-19",
